id: balloon-flash-bomber
name: Balloon Flash Bomber
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score 16+
tpCost: 10
# Asked as it is used: twice the Ghosts, each one more at its 3(bT).
ghostsDouble: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack may make twice the Kamikaze Ghosts.
text: >
  Balloon Flash Bomber: You create even more of your ghostly duplicates!
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score 16+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: When you use the Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack Unique Ability, you may double the amount of Kamikaze Ghosts you
  create.
